WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:09.899
Information assurance and cyber security are greatly

2
00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:12.199
involved with the risk management process.

3
00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.299
The level of cyber security required depends on the level of risk.

4
00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:18.079
The entity is willing to accept

5
00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:22.479
that is the potential consequences of what's going on in our environment.

6
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:25.340
Once we evaluate this risk,

7
00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:28.219
then we will implement security controls to mitigate

8
00:00:28.229 --> 00:00:30.540
the risk to the level that we find acceptable

9
00:00:31.659 --> 00:00:34.650
risks can be from cyber attacks such as malware,

10
00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:37.750
social engineering or denial of service attacks

11
00:00:38.139 --> 00:00:41.810
or from other situations that affect our environment such as fire,

12
00:00:41.819 --> 00:00:44.200
